      refine List.isChain_append.2 ⟨hch.take _, ?_, ?_⟩
      · refine List.isChain_cons.2 ⟨?_, List.isChain_cons.2 ⟨?_, List.isChain_append.2 ⟨sch, hch.drop _, ?_⟩⟩⟩
        · intro z hz
